div.p:
JCS agreed that the recommended sequence would be: get additional intelligence:
                    make surprise attacks on missiles, airfields, PT boats, SAMs and tanks;
                    concurrently, reinforce Guantanamo; prepare to initiate an invasion.

JCS meeting at 1630 attended by Adm. Dennison (CINCLANT), Gen. Power (CINCSAC),
                    Gen. Sweeney (CG, TAC) and LTG Hamilton Howze (SG [illegible in the original]
                    Abn Corps);
